  <h3>Return &amp; Exchange Policy</h3>
  <p>At Muqavi Herbs, customer satisfaction is our priority. Please read our return and exchange policy carefully before placing your order.</p>

  <h4>Eligibility for Returns &amp; Exchanges</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Majoon-e-Muqavi can only be returned or exchanged if the product seal and packaging remain completely unopened and unused.</li>
    <li>Products that have been opened, used, or tampered with are not eligible for return or exchange due to hygiene and safety reasons.</li>
    <li>If you receive a damaged, defective, or incorrect product, you may be eligible for a return or replacement after verification by our team.</li>
    <li>Customers experiencing an allergic reaction should discontinue use and contact our customer support team for assistance.</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>How to Return or Exchange</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Contact Muqavi Herbs Customer Support at <strong>0339-0091552</strong> to initiate your return or exchange request.</li>
    <li>Our team will guide you through the return process and arrange pickup through an authorized courier service, where applicable.</li>
    <li>Once we receive and inspect the returned product, eligible refunds or exchanges will be processed.</li>
    <li>A deduction of Rs. 500 applies to refunds only. No deduction applies to approved exchanges.</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Return &amp; Exchange Timeframe</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Customers can request a return or exchange within <strong>7 days of receiving their parcel</strong>, including the delivery date.</li>
    <li>Requests submitted after the 7-day period will not be accepted.</li>
    <li>To speed up the process, please share clear pictures of the parcel, product packaging, and delivery slip with our support team.</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Change of Mind Policy</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Returns due to a change of mind are not accepted.</li>
    <li>Products must meet all eligibility requirements to qualify for a return or exchange.</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Contact Us</h4>
  <p>For return and exchange assistance, contact us:</p>
  <p>
    <strong>Muqavi Herbs Official Support</strong><br>
    WhatsApp: 0339-0091552<br>
    Website: muqaviherbsofficial.com
  </p>
